<title>CHILE: Chile's CMPC 9-mo net falls.</title>
<headline>Chile's CMPC 9-mo net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forestry firm Empresas CMPC SA reported the following results in the first nine months of the year compared with the same period 1995.</p>
<p>				9-mo 1996	  9-mo 1995</p>
<p>Net profit			32.76    profit  61.23</p>
<p>Operating loss		   5.15    profit  36.69</p>
<p>Non-operating profit	  36.67    profit  30.35</p>
<p>Total revenues		   5.04	     140.92</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of Chilean pesos.</p>
<p>The large drop in revenues was due to the transferral of the company's wood pulp sales from CMPC, the holding company, to a new subsidiary, Celulosa.</p>
<p>-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212</p>
</text>
